window.products.push({"id":670092,"name":"YCOCO Large Butter Dish with Lid,Ceramic Butter Container With Airtight Cover,Butter Keeper Double Silicone Seals with Knife for kitchen,Holds 2 Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMLc8VU-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Best Thing about our product is that it comes with an Mini Knife , Don't worry about not having a butter knife when you want to cut some butter. The wooden bamboo lid has a sealed silicone ring, which helps to keep the butter fresh for longer, without absorbing the taste of other foods in the fridge. Our Butter Dish (6.5\"X 3 \"X 4 \") is which is wide and deep enough to hold standard sticks of butter. Works perfectly for all types of butter. The ceramic design makes it easier to clean, you can simply rinse it with water or put it in the dishwasher to clean. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: If for any reason you're not completely happy with your purchase- simply let us know and we will either replace it or refund your money!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMLc8VU-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YCOCO","source_asin":"B0B84MN1DL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B84MN1DL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B84MN1DL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670093,"name":"Boston International Cocktail Napkin Caddy, Garden Gate Design in Antique White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrMq8bQyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Metal framed napkin caddy keeps disposable paper napkins, or folded linen ones, handy and clean. Flat caddy makes single napkins easy to pick up and accessible from all angles, unlike upright holders that napkins fold down over each other in and have to be accessed from only one direction. Use to keep the dinner table or buffet organized, place by the kitchen or bathroom sink as a hand washing valet, or keep on the bar for mixed drinks, cocktails and appetizers. It was the love and appreciation of fine design along with the opportunity to create and market well-made yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to found Boston International (BI) in 1986. In the beginning, BI was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany and the UK. Through the years, the company developed and grew. In 1996, Boston International added Ideal Home Range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that, BI began its relationship with New York's Metropolitan Museum of Art. Through the combination of these lines, BI has become a major force in the gift industry today. Ideal Home Range has gained a richly deserved worldwide reputation as the preeminent manufacturer of paper napkins in all sizes, from 5 x 5-inch cocktail napkins, to 6.5-inch square lunch napkins, to 8.5 x 4.5-inch guest towels that can double as buffet napkins. Browse all the thick, 3-ply napkins from IHR for casual and elegant designs to fill any and all napkin caddies from Boston International.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrMq8bQyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B07JLHHTND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JLHHTND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JLHHTND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
