window.products.push({"id":670104,"name":"Numola Silicone Baking Mats Set of 4 Including 2 Quarter Sheet Liner, 1 Round Pizza Mat & 1 Square Cake Pan Mat, Food Grade Baking Mat, BPA Free Non-S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819XoA23BcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ Safe Material - Our silicone baking mats are made of food grade silicone and fiberglass, the quality is first-class. The material is tasteless and safe, hence they can contact directly with foods. No need for oils, cooking sprays, or butter when baking anymore, which is good for a healthier diet. Silicone material has strong flexibility, it is not easy to deform. ★ Multi Function - Numola baking mat perfect for Baking, Macaron, Pizza, Cookie, Candies, Biscuits, Meat Vegetables, or Kneading, etc. The silicone baking sheets can provide even heat distribution during baking foods. Whether you're a beginner or a professional baker, you can make perfect food instead of burn and under baked spots. When you need it, you can use a free brush to make the food crispy. ★ Oven & Microwave Safe - The premium silicone baking sheet is heat resistant from -40℉to 480℉, suitable for all type of ovens or microwaves. And no more burned, under-baked spots, odor, harmful substance,etc.(some creases are normal resulting from in the process of transportation that don't affect the use). ★ Non-stick and Easy to Clean - The silicone baking slip mats have smooth surface that are non-stick. You can reduce the time in the process of making food instead taking time to scrape dough. Baked bread is also easy to slip off the baking mat. It’s convenient and easy to clean it in warm soapy water(dishwasher safe). A silicone bandage as a bonus will be good for storing them. ★ Reusable - These silicone mat for baking sheet are 0.7mm thickness which is almost double thicker than other 0.4mm thickness baking sheets, and it doesn't slide back and forth when you roll the dough. Our bread mat is more durable that can be used more than 2000 times, which reduces the cost of disposable parchment and aluminum foil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819XoA23BcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Numola","source_asin":"B0924D9K77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0924D9K77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0924D9K77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
