window.products.push({"id":670373,"name":"Handmade Swedish Gnome, Scandinavian Tomte, Yule Santa Nisse, Nordic Figurine, Plush Elf Toy, Winter Table Ornament, Home Christmas Decorations, Holid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mcuFotAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A LUCKY GNOME --- Gnome or Tomte, an effective talisman, according to Scandinavian folklore, he is elderly, with a long beard. The Tomte is reputed to safeguard the farms, family and children, particularly at night, protecting them from misfortune. Gnomes are best known for guarding Earthly treasures and are perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies or attracting health, love and money. PERFECT GIFT --- Gnome is a traditionalist and perfect for spreading Holiday spirit. Put them in the entrance, under the Christmas tree or decorate the Nursery with them and they will bring a look of fairy tale warmth and coziness. They would be the festive addition to your shelf & table and home decoration. Gnomes are perfect gifts for family & friends?? home at Christmas/ Festival day and Party time! Speak to the dwarfs any desire you wish - he will try to make it come true. DIMENSION & MATERIAL --- Wear a red tartan suit with 15/ 12/ 8.5 inches tall from bottom to top of hat, and 6/ 5/ 4 inches wide. His very tall & grey traditional knitted hat and his felt mittens hide his ears and fingers safe from the cold. The fiber fur long brown beard and bulbous nose are well-known traits of the cunning gnome. Bendable wire in ridiculously tall hats in order to pose it for maximum whimsy and ridiculousness! Features weighted bottom for extra stability. PACKAGE INCLUDED --- ITOMTE series products brochure x 1 (with promotional information & gnome's adventure story), gnome/ tomte x 1, reusable gift bag printed ITOMTE brand x1. Please be sure that your gnomes are come in a bag with ITOMTE name, with a view to avoid a mistaken purchase of infringing product and without any guarantee by ITOMTE. Search and Follow ITOMTE official accounts to win promotion code or mystery grab bag for free, or log in as member on www.itomte.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mcuFotAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITOMTE","source_asin":"B07VBR8KDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBR8KDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBR8KDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
