window.products.push({"id":670406,"name":"AirTang Personal Air Purifier Necklace, Portable Mini Small Ionizer Plug in Purifiers,Wearable Cleaner for Car, Bedroom, Home, Travel Kids Adults, Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dmypge0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Principle of small air purifier necklace: Negative ions are released to air molecules and filthy particles attached to the air,giving them a negative charge. When other air molecules carry a positive charge, they attract negatively charged molecules and particles. Positively and negatively charged molecules and particles form particulate matter, which sinks to the ground due to geocentric attraction and blocks harmful substances from entering the human respiratory system. The Personal Portable AirIonizer Specification: Anion concentration:120 million ions Working voltage: DC 5V Working power: <1W Current : <50mA Battery capacity: 850mAh Display: LED Charging interface: USB-C Charging time: about 2 hours Product weight: 48g Materials:ABC+PC Product size: 80*35*23mm Package Includes: Portable Air Purifier x1 Charging Cable x 1 Manual x1 Pounchx1 NOTE: 1. Don't touch the brush when working 2. People who have heart disease or wear a pacemaker are prohibited from using it; 3. Do not invade the wearable mini air purifier into the liquid. Do not use the machine during the bathing process, it is not waterproof; 4. Keep away from heat sources, such as radiators, heaters or other heat generating equipment; away from gas stoves and ovens ect. 5. Do not disassemble and repair without permission. The personal wearable negative ion air purifier comes with One Year guarantee. If you have any questions about using , Our after-sales team will assist you in a satisfactory way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dmypge0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09JG9BN4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JG9BN4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JG9BN4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
