window.products.push({"id":670413,"name":"3-Cup Stovetop Espresso Maker, Italian Moka Pot Coffee Maker, Italian Cuban Expresso Stove Top Small Coffee Maker Machine Flavor Strong Cafetera Perco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SHXlNz+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【5.3OZ 3 CUP SMALL ESPRESSO SHOTS & VARIOUS HEATING METHODS】Espresso maker Stovetop espresso maker Available in 3 cup small espresso shots, max boiler capacity is 150ml. Suitable capacity, prefect for 1-2 people, won't cause waste.Alternative heating methods: electric stove, gas stove, alcohol lamp, electric ceramic stove, Please be careful not to use high heat to cook, otherwise it will melt the plastic handle, just heat it for 3-5 minutes, Will get the rich& high quality of espresso coffee. ❤【SAFE-TY RELEASE VALVE & STURDY INSULATED PLASTIC HANDLE】Advanced upgrade of pure copper decompression valve, luxhaus stovetop espresso maker, Safety valve will regulates the internal pressure of pot by releasing the pressure during the brewing process, automatically relieve the pressure to prevent accidents. Please pay attention to the water level when adding water. Flame retardant handle will stay cool safe to the touch, addressing a common complaint of hot handles burnt fingers. ❤【EASY TO USE & EASY TO CLEAN】The coffee maker consist of a collecting chamber, a bottom chamber, a funnel-shaped metal filter. You can unscrew and remove the filter funnel from the base. Fill the base with water up to the level of the safety valve and insert the filter funnel. Fill the filter with ground coffee, and screw the top firmly to the base. After used, just simply rinse with clean water and let all the components air-dry in upright position before reassembling(NOT dishwasher safe). ❤【EIGHT-SIDED SHAPE & PRACTICAL THOUGHTFUL DESIGN】The moka pot is made of premium aluminium which can make it last long, features eight-sided octagon shape to diffuse heat and enhance the aroma of your coffee. Excellent quality, all parts are tightly connected, and the sealing is very good. During the coffee brewing process, there will be no coffee spillage. The humanized spout design and plastic handle will not cause trouble when pouring coffee. ☎【CLASSIC STOVETOP ESPRESSO MAKER & PROTABLE SIZE】Use our espresso machine, you can easily making the best traditional espresso quier or milk frother, make lattes or cappuccino at home with easily, bring you the perfect solution to enjoy your morning coffee! Mini size and durable, ideal for indoor and outdoor. Even during camping, traveling, climbing, or picnic, you can enjoy a cup of fragrant coffee! We provide higher quality products and thoughtful service, 30-Day Warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SHXlNz+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milky House","source_asin":"B08QCQ3CFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCQ3CFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCQ3CFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
