window.products.push({"id":670500,"name":"Oval Spring Tension Rod 16-24\" By Graber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oKWSrdrmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Spring Window Fashions Oval Spring Tension Curtain Rod 16 to 24-inch Adjustable Width - White It's back to the basics with this Graber or Spring Window oval spring tension curtain rod. Temporary or permanent, this rod will simply and durably dress up your windows. This spring tension rod uses a unique twist tight tool free system and is perfect for hanging draperies between two flat surfaces. The rod's solid metal design with plastic ends holds the rod in place without marking the mounting surface. Extends 16'' to 24'' adjustable width. Each package includes one rod. This rod had no projection. The oval spring tension curtain rods are wall mounted and only need a screwdriver to install Oval Spring Tension Curtain Rods have a Versatile use: Spring extension rods can be used as window curtain rod, closet rods shower curtain rod and any other place like cabinet, closet, refrigerator where the rod is needed to adjust the length to the desired state.  The \"lock-seam\" design gives the curtain rod that additional strength needed for medium to heavy curtain fabrics. Threader attached to the rod ensures smooth, no-snag shirring.  Firm gripping plastic ends hold the rod securely in place without damaging mounting surface  The rubber stopper on each end is designed to leave your paint unmarred and to blend in with the rod's neutral white finish. Slide your favorite curtain or sheer onto this drapery rod, pop it into place and you've instantly got that great look you were after and, most importantly, without putting holes in the wall. You'll love how quickly your decorating vision comes to life.  This Curtain Rod is easy to install and extremely durable. This is an authentic product by Graber or Spring Window Fashions and includes all necessary installation hardware and instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oKWSrdrmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Graber","source_asin":"B006ZS1NVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006ZS1NVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006ZS1NVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
