window.products.push({"id":670525,"name":"8\" Chef and 5\" Utility Knife Kit Plus 8\" Universal Sheath from A Cut Above Cutlery Made with Full Tang Stainless Steel and Impact Resistant ABS Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-hCmJ-jmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have exactly the right knife for all of your cooking needs high-quality knives are indispensable tools in any kitchen. Well-balanced, sharp knives require less brute force, do less damage to foods and herbs, and allow you to work faster and safer. Our 8\" chef knife and 5\" utility knife kit ensures that you have ultra-sharp tools for any kitchen task. Whether you need to carve a turkey, mince garlic bulbs or chop vegetables, a cut above cutlery knives are designed to make slick, clean cuts. Comfort, durability and safety take the drudgery out of cooking these handsome knives have full tang blades, each made of a single piece of stainless steel, sharpened to a fine edge, and then heat-tempered and polished to ensure their longevity and effectiveness. Molded ABS 430 handles are impact- and heat-resistant to prevent breakage, and to provide optimal dexterity and balance. Delicate ingredients like herbs will look fresher longer, and your fingers will be safer because you won't have dull blades slipping off of foods as you cut. Included with each purchase: An 8\" universal knife sheath to protect your blades from nicks and other damage, and a knife skills eBook of professional grips and time-saving tips. Designed to be the pride of any chef our chef and utility knife kit arrives handsomely gift-boxed, suitable for housewarmings, weddings and holiday giving. The chef is your life will have no doubt that you appreciate their culinary skills. Both knives are covered by a 5-year warranty. If they should not perform to your expectations during that time, simply return them for a 100% refund of your purchase price. Make any meal a culinary masterpiece. Add the a cut above cutlery chef and utility knife kit to your cart today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-hCmJ-jmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Cut Above Cutlery","source_asin":"B019A6L2DI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019A6L2DI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019A6L2DI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670526,"name":"Linenwalas 100% Organic Cotton Percale Bed Pattern Sheets Set 4PC - Soft Luxurious Cotton Bedding (Queen, Navy Blue Frette)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isGB8my0L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For 2020 REFRESH COOL BEDDING: LINENWALAS provides you organic cotton sheets specially made from 100% Long Staple Cotton. The Organic Cotton bed sheets are known for their sweat-wicking feature. This temperature Balancing cotton sheets keep you cool and moisture-free during summer and warm and cozy during winters. These fully combed Organic Cotton Sheets are Ultra Soft, Long Lasting, Durable, and Luxurious Bedding Sheets. LINENWALAS PERFECT SNUG FIT: This Organic Cotton 16 inches Deep Pocket Queen-Size sheets set is stitched using premium quality elastic to give fitted sheet tight fitting. Fitted sheet fits mattresses from 9” to 16” thick. Queen sheets: 90” x 102”; Fully Elastic Fitted sheet having pockets depth: 60” x 80” + 16”; with 2 Standard Pillowcases: 20” x 30”. This Organic Cotton Queen Size Bedsheets and Pillowcase have a stylish Hem detailing across the border which make them a stylish Recommendation. GENUINE 300 THREAD COUNT PERCALE SHEETS: These sheets set will provide you an endless comfort of Luxurious Hotel Class Linen at an AFFORDABLE price. This 300 Thread Count Pure Organic Percale Cotton Sheet Set has low maintenance, and easy care is required. We at LINENWALAS make sheets from premium quality fabric without using any dyes which get faded over time, thus keeping sheet bright-toned even after prolonged use. But using cream or bleach to clean sheets may lead to color fade. GOODNESS OF NATURE: All our Organic Cotton Sheets are MADE IN GREEN and are Certified by GOTS. According to the policies, these sheet sets are tested for various parameters i.e; they are manufactured in a socially responsible manner with Eco-friendly ways. Each product batch is also tested for numerous different parameters such as long-lasting, durability, low color fading, low shrinkage, and pilling. Each of our sheets set is further quality checked before packing. LINENWALAS ONE-YEAR WARRANTY: These cotton bedding sets are made from the superior quality processes and with best quality cottton. If you face any issues with the 100% cotton sheets set, please send us an email or contact us via amazon message. Your satisfaction is our number one priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isGB8my0L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linenwalas","source_asin":"B07GZTJM6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZTJM6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZTJM6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670527,"name":"Silicone Molds Baking for Mousse Cake, 3D Baking Molds Dessert Molds for Pastry Truffle Pudding Jelly Cheesecake, Halloween Pumpkin Shape, 6-Cavity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3139wzQZLxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Specification: -Name: 1*6 even Pumpkin silicone mold -Color: White-Material: Food grade silicone -Mold Size: 11.6*6.69*1.97 inch -Cavities Size:2.76*1.96*1.97inch -Weight:130g -Temperature range: -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit(-40 to +230 degrees Celsius) Features: Non-toxic, dust resistant, durable, no permeate. Easy to clean, easy to demould, reusable. Temperature resistance wide range. Suitable for microwave oven, oven, refrigerator. Pay attention when using: 1- Before use: please clean and then disinfect in boiling water. 2- After use: Please clean and keep it away from direct sunlight. 3- In order to extend the mold life, please don’t use cool water to clean immediately when it’s just taken out of the oven. 4- Do not directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as the oven heating tube). 5- It is recommended that you place the mold in the middle or upper position of the oven during baking, and keep the distance between the heating tube and the heating tube at least 2inch(5cm). 6- Do not use the Crisp button of the microwave oven. 7- Use neutral detergent in a dishwasher or hot water to clean it normally with a sponge. Turn the mold over when cleaning, and the cleaning effect is better. 8- Do not approach the sharps or use steel balls and other hard cleaning tools. Package Include: 1*6 even Pumpkin silicone mold GZFDYW sincerely hopes our products can bring happiness to your family and friends. If you have any questions or provide us with suggestions for modification, please contact us. Let us get better","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3139wzQZLxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ruiqier","source_asin":"B08K86M5NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K86M5NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K86M5NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
