window.products.push({"id":670627,"name":"J Devlin Box 621-3 Hexagon Clear Glass Trinket Box Keepsake Gift Decorative Jewelry Ring Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DDdEF7dtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The owner of J. Devlin Glass Art was inspired to create stained glass by the beautiful Tiffany lamps that decorated her grandfather's home. This small glass keepsake box is made in the style of stain glass, with pieces of iridescent glass soldered together. The hexagonal box measures 2.5\" x 2.75\" x 1.5\" and the top opens with a hinge. A small chain keeps the box lid from swinging too far open, and a metal thumb tab allows you to open the box easily. This box is a beautiful place to store small treasures!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DDdEF7dtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Devlin Glass Art","source_asin":"B007NZRT3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007NZRT3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007NZRT3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670628,"name":"Dried Eucalyptus for Shower & Lavender and Rose Flowers Bundle, 17'' Natural Real Live Eucalyptus Leaves Greenery Stems & Aromatic Lavender Shower Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tKK1YRLNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Home spa：Use the steam of the shower to release eucalyptus essential oil, plus the scent of lavender with roses, and easily enjoy its aromatherapy. Our dried eucalyptus and dried lavender and roses are naturally dry, so maybe have some compressed and deformed after a long journey, it's inevitable, You can stretch the leaves back to their original shape by hand. Natural Plants： Select high-quality eucalyptus and lavender with roses. The package includes 15 pcs dried eucalyptus stems and dried Lavender with about 10 roses（lengths 15''-17''）A lavender and rose sachet,A coil of hemp rope. After unpacking, there will be some scattered Lavender seeds in it, which are particularly easy to fall off. This is also the characteristic of natural plants. You can collect them to make sachets, which is the source of fragrance. SPA Enjoyment：Natural plant fragrance,without any additives,retains the original smell of Eucalyptus and lavender with roses. Hot steam stimulate the essential oil of Eucalyptus and lavender.It can purify the air, calm, hypnotic, relieve stress, relax you,relieve upper respiratory problems and rejuvenate you. Best Decoration：Eucalyptus and lavender with roses are the ideal choice for various places. They have their own fragrance and are the most original aromatherapy machines. They are suitable for making wall hanging decor, bedrooms, bathrooms, cafes, gardens, restaurants, offices, etc. Also suitable for wedding bouquet, party decoration, used to create a warm and comfortable home environment. The fragrance will fade over time, so it is recommended to replace it regularly. Perfect Gift：Eucalyptus shower gives them the stress relief and relaxation they need and deserve. Perfect gift for friends, family, mom and dad. The special preservation technology makes them look like fresh plants even though they have been picked for a long time. If they are used in the wet environment for a long time, there may be liquid overflow (colored glycerin), don't worry, that is non-toxic and harmless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tKK1YRLNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qunwreath","source_asin":"B0BQ6V2YPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ6V2YPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ6V2YPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
