window.products.push({"id":670642,"name":"Deluxe 6 PC 400 Thread Count 100% Cotton Sateen Dobby Stripe Sheet Set (Full, Coffee)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cYZc4ZRIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience luxury like you've never felt before. This Crystal Trading Microfiber Bed Sheet Set will bring your dreams to a whole new level. Slip between the covers and surround yourself in the sinful luxury that this bedding offers. Soft like cotton , this lightweight and breathable sheet set is crafted from 100% GSM microfiber material , making it ideal for use during any season. Add in delightfully soft, ultra-plush pillowcases , and you'll truly feel pampered. Plus, this wrinkle-resistant material is also hypoallergenic and resistant to dust to ensure optimal comfort . This 4-piece sheet set comes in twin, full, queen and king sizes to accommodate all mattresses – each set includes a flat sheet, fitted sheet and two pillowcases except for the twin size which includes one pillowcase. For added comfort and a perfect fit, the fitted sheet features elastic all around with deep pockets that fit mattresses up to 15\" deep . To top it off, the sheets are soft and luxurious , boasting a long-lasting sheen in a sateen weave . A dobby stripe pattern creates increased visual appeal, bringing a touch of class to any bedroom space. It's available in a variety of beautiful colors – black, white, sage, light blue, burgundy, gold, silver, coffee and beige – to meet everyone’s needs. No matter which one you choose, when morning comes and the alarm clock goes off, you just might be tempted to crawl farther beneath these covers and try to pick up where your dreams left off!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cYZc4ZRIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Home","source_asin":"B01N9KBV6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9KBV6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9KBV6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670643,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Lanikai Vertical by Cameron Brooks, 12x19-Inch Fine Art, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U5MxKAGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a mountain coming out of the water. Prominent Colors: Light Blue, Teal, Blue, White, Black Cameron Brooks was born and raised in Honolulu, Hi. and graduated from Punahou academy in 2001. He has been specializing in aerial photography of the Hawaiian islands for the last 2 years, and has captured remote areas of Oahu and Kauai in ways that have never been seen before. There have been numerous articles published about his work by the Huffington Post in 2014 that have helped to propel his career to new heights. \"The greatest part of my job.. Is flying low over popular surf spots.. That is one of the most spiritual experiences a person could have on earth.. I wish to convey that feeling through my imagery.\" Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U5MxKAGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07FV8GS4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FV8GS4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FV8GS4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
