window.products.push({"id":670758,"name":"Fokenzary Hand Painted Oil Painting on Canvas Pop Art Cool Ape Listening Music with Headphone Framed Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hwEIYs+ZL._AC_SL1319_.jpg","description":"Please note that since the paintings are hand painted, it might be a tiny difference from the picture,handmade artworks can not be exact the same like the products made by machineThe product has different sizes measured by cm,S: 40x50cm M: 50x60cm L:60x80cm,please choose the right size so you get the best decorative effectPainted on high quality canvas and environmental oil paints material,wooden inner frame,nails are provided,easy to hang it on the wallOil paints are waterproof.Paintings can be cleaned by wet cloth,please avoid long time directly strong sunlight,this may cause painting split,color fading and discoloration","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hwEIYs+ZL._AC_SL1319_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fokenzary","source_asin":"B06XKY752B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XKY752B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XKY752B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670759,"name":"artgeist Canvas Wall Art Print World Map 40x20 in - 5pcs Home Decor Framed Stretched Picture Photo Painting Artwork Image k-A-0013-b-o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1N6HMIvTGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANVAS PICTURES Printed pictures are trending lately when it comes to interior designing – they serve as an alternative to classic paintings.High quality materials and large-format printers give us the opportunity to recreate even the tiniest details of the copied photography. Pictures are also UV-resistant and this is why colors are sharper than ever. Every picture is stretched over a wooden frame – you don’t need to worry about any additional utilities in order to put it on the wall. To make sure that the painting will look great on your wall, we mount the canvas onto a matched stretcher bar made of Natureeeal, solid wood (1,5 cm thick).We offer a whole variety of different themed pictures, that will give you the possibility to make your surroundings lovelier and hopefully unlock your inner creativity. The highest possible quality and modern approach will surely meet your expectations as a client.Also, keep in mind - we do not offer stocked items - every order is being produced individually after the purchase. Products are made exclusively in our own manufacturing facilities – hence, we offer the best quality vs. price ratio. IMPORTANT In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a certain distance between them (compare it with the picture displayed online).Please keep in mind that because of the screen settings, actual colours may vary from the ones visible on the picture online. Pictures are only displayed for illustration purposes. They serve as an exemplar of how the canvas print might look like in a particular surrounding. Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.It's possible only to send 3 products in one package, so if you want to order more products, please submit an appropriate number of individual orders.All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1N6HMIvTGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B07MW7NG5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MW7NG5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MW7NG5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670760,"name":"Bath Pillow, Mr. Bathif Bath Pillows for Tub with Neck Shoulder Back Support, 3D Air Mesh and 6 Non-Slip Strong Suction Cups, Luxury Spa Bath Tub Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IaSWZlUZL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝【3D Comfortable Quick Dry Fabric】3D Air Mesh Fabric are allergy-friendly and contain no chemical, with good air permeability and skin-friendliness is perfect for everyone, including people with sensitive skin. One-piece design bath cushion reduces the pressure on your back, shoulders and tailbone, while providing extra-thick headrest to support your tired neck and head. 💝【Powerful Non Slip Design】Mr. Bathif bath pillow for bathtub has 6 suction cups with strong suction power which can be used to affix the bath pillow to the surface of the bathtub well and make sure the bath pillow will not slip to providing a safe and comfortable bathing experience. When removing the suction cups, just gently pick the tab on the suction cups with your finger. 💝【Machine Washable & Dry Quickly】Our pillows are machine washable or clean by hand , it also has a hook that allows it to be hung on a towel rail, so that the pillow dries quickly and always smells fresh and clean. The bathtub pillow are fade-resistant and always looks like new. And this fabric allows constant airflow throughout the pillow that keeps it comfortable, cool and heavenly. 💝【Great Neck & Back Support】】Our bath pillows for tub ergonomically designed to perfectly fit your body curve and to provide soft and powerful support for your head, neck, shoulders, help you enjoy comfort and relaxation as long as you could, relieve the fatigue of a day's work! 💝【Great Addition to the Bath】Buy with confidence! It is a great present for your family or friends. If you are not positively thrilled with our bathtub cushion, please feel free to contact us and we will issue a replacement or full refund quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IaSWZlUZL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Bathif","source_asin":"B08MZFC44W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MZFC44W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MZFC44W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670761,"name":"PHOYAL Natural Rattan 2 Doors Buffet Storage Cabinets, 2 Tier Adjustable Shelves Accent Cabinet, Free Standing Console Table Sideboard Buffet Cabinet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eBwhk95UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HANDMADE NATURAL RATTAN】: The rattan buffet storage cabinet with doors is a combination of MDF wood and handmade natural rattan, the clean lines and natural tones, which add appeal to your home, as a accent storage cabinet, the simple style and classic color make it can match well with any other furniture in your house 【LARGE STORAGE SPACE】: The sideboard buffet table with 2 handmade natural rattan decorated doors features a spacious top and two large storage cabinets, the internal shelf contains three adjustable positions, which greatly improves the freedom and flexibility of storage. It is great to place display items or decorations or necessities, make you room tidy and orderly. It is perfect for your living room bedroom dining room entryway kitchen 【MAGNETIC DOOR DESIGN】: Symmetrical 2 Magnetic Door Design, prominent round door handle, convenient opening and closing, moderate length, not easy to bump even when walking around the cabinet 【STABLE & STURDY STRUCTURE】: The accent cabinet with storage is made of high-grade MDF with solid wood legs , which ensure it sturdy and stable, this material is safe and environmentally friendly, ensure no harm and odorless, it service a long life. The kitchen buffet storage cabinet not only store your items, also is a nice addition as a home decor 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE】: The sideboard buffet storage cabinet with Handmade natural rattan doors is easy to assemble. Overall Dimension is 31.5”*15.75”*34.65”(L*W*H). Recommended weight capacity is 150lbs for top and 22 lbs for each shelf. We offer clear and easy-to-read instructions and marked all the spare parts, ensure it pretty simple for everyone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eBwhk95UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHOYAL","source_asin":"B09WKBBRQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WKBBRQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WKBBRQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670762,"name":"David Bowman My Child Wall Art Print Jesus Christ Kissing Child Religious Spiritual Christian Fine Art (3x4 pack of 10)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hWo3tQU6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Artist David Bowman’s “Expressions of Christ” series captures the love of our Savior in an up close and personal way---The only thing that can even remotely compare to Christ’s compassion for each of us is the love of a parent for his/her child. Thus, the models used for this piece were actually a father and his daughter. For both these reasons, it is called MY CHILD.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hWo3tQU6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"David Bowman","source_asin":"B0BY3TBRW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY3TBRW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY3TBRW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
