window.products.push({"id":670781,"name":"I-Semble Vertical Mount Murphy Bed Twin Hardware Kit – Twin Size Murphy Bed Hardware Includes Tubular Steel Mattress Platform – Twin Beds Vertical Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":419.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ViGsgcIkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Rockler Woodworking I-Semble Vertical-Mount Murphy Bed Hardware With Mattress Platform: Maximize your space with our murphy bed hardware twin size kit. With no springs to break or slacken over time, you'll get years of reliable performance from this twin size bed kit vertical mount hardware. The metal legs at the foot of the murphy bed wall mount swing out for a level sleeping surface when opened, and the whole mechanism holds the bed securely closed when not in use. Instructions are included for easy installation of our vertical murphy bed hardware and plans for building a basic cabinet enclosure. This twin size murphy bed is compatible with mattresses up to 10'' thick. Choose from our queen, full, and twin sizes. --- Murphy Bed Hardware Kit Features: Includes tubular steel mattress frame for strength and improved weight distribution - Comes with cambered wood slats for comfort. - Recommended for standard mattress sizes up to 10'' thick. - No box spring is used. --- WHAT’S INCLUDED: (1) Mattress Platform with Wood Slats - (1) Set of Detailed Instructions/Plans for a Cabinet Enclosure --- Specifications: Dimensions (cabinet enclosure): 78-1/2''H x 42-7/8''W x 17''D (closed) - Projection: 89-1/8'' --- About Us: The history of Rockler Woodworking and Hardware goes back to 1954, when Norton Rockler started the Minnesota Woodworkers Supply Company in north Minneapolis. It was a small mail-order business with a big aspiration – to become woodworkers' go-to resource for everything they need to complete their projects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ViGsgcIkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I-Semble","source_asin":"B06XDQ9MMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XDQ9MMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XDQ9MMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":670782,"name":"ATMOBLUE Face Mask - Dual Fan - Replaceable HEPA Filters - Adaptable Silicone Seal - 3 Speed Settings - No App required","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jTVBZ2baS._AC_.jpg","description":"Adaptable and Modern Form Fitting : ATMOBLUE is not a 3M full face mask on the market. It’s better. Our solution is sleek, compact, and lightweight. Our modern design is intended to sit from the bridge of the nose to just under your bottom lip instead of the chin. Optimal sized to protect your breathing zone, and reduce the amount of silicone touch points on your face - which eliminates additional moisture build up. Not only that but also the silicone will adapt to the shape of your face within 2 weeks of consistent use. You haven’t seen a custom mask like this before. Larger face? Perhaps this mask isn't for you. That said, over 95% of our customers agree, ATMOBLUE is the future of facemasks. Decide How Much Fresh Air You Want, When You Need It : ATMOBLUE features three speed control settings which can be adjusted to your preference. Integrated, dual fans, delivers fresh filtered air, make wearing a mask effortless. Portable : Ensure air quality anywhere you travel including on the job, while traveling, shopping for groceries or even while taking a light jog. ATMOBLUE clears the air. Vital Positive Airflow : The term positive airflow means pushing excess air into a given space. Positive Air Pressure allows users to breath effortlessly with zero resistance. With our one of a kind solution, unwanted air is expelled from your breathing zone allowing you to breathe with ease and confidence. Includes — ATMOBLUE Electric Mask - With 2 Pre-Installed Filters (a lifespan approx. 150 Hours, 4-6 Weeks) — Black Interchangeable Face Plate (Pre-Installed) — ATMOBLUE Mobile App COMING SOON (Mask works 100% without the App) — USB Cable Included - Rechargeable Airflow System Runs Approx. 3-8 Hours Per Charge (Li Batteries) - Use With Standard 5V=1A Wall Charger (Not Included) — Carrying Bag With Clip","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jTVBZ2baS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATMOBLUE","source_asin":"B0981H61MV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0981H61MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0981H61MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
