window.products.push({"id":670831,"name":"Mozaic Home Papasan Cushion, 1 Count (Pack of 1), Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914ZwFA33VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Embellish your beloved papasan chair with a fresh new cushion that doesn’t skimp on style! This stunning indoor papasan cushion is classically tufted with buttons and stitching, plus extra plush padding for ultimate comfort. Choose either 44” or 48” size in a variety of beautiful colors. PRODUCT FEATURES: Tufted Papasan Cushion Thick and Comfortable Indoor Use Only Made in USA Material Type: Polyester AVAILABLE IN: Colors Black, Blue, Blush Pink, Coral, Ice Mint, Ivory, Mustard, Red, Seafoam, Silver, Wedge Wood. Dimensions 44” and 48” VERSATILE INDOOR USE Use it as a comfortable Japanese floor cushion for dining, having tea, entertaining guests, and relaxing afterwards. Deepen your meditation practice or yoga flow with the addition of a cushion to enhance positions and breathwork. Use it as a cushion topper for a hanging seat, hammock seat, wicker chair, rattan chair, swivel seat, rocking chair, or Acapulco chair. NOT for outdoor use. THICK AND COMFORTABLE Exquisitely soft and plush yet supportive, this papasan cushion is designed for adults but kids can’t resist it either! It makes an eye-catching piece of comfortable and functional decor for living rooms, bedrooms, and entertainment areas. Got pets at home? They’ll love the new bed you “bought for them”. How thoughtful of their favorite human! EASY TO KEEP CLEAN When you’ve got potential dirty doggy paws and kitty claw marks to deal with, it’s essential that your papasan cushion is easy to clean. Since the cover is not removable, simply soak a washcloth in hot water, wring completely, and wipe down soiled areas. Repeat as needed. MADE IN USA Made in the USA with plush polyester cushioning and a thick tufted design offering just the right amount of support, combined with the perfect sinking effect. Furniture/seat base not included. Cushion cover cannot be removed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914ZwFA33VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaic","source_asin":"B0C517CZ5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-670831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C517CZ5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C517CZ5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
